# Spike + heavy abrupt disconnections: burst to concurrency, but ~40% of calls drop HARD
# (socket killed, no clean WS close) early. Tests whether the LB's in-flight accounting
# recovers from ungraceful drops (a pod whose in-flight count is inflated by dead sockets
# would wrongly be avoided; one whose count under-counts would be overloaded).
CONC=150
RUN_S=720
ARRIVAL=burst
LONG_PCT=25
MED_PCT=35
ABRUPT_PCT=40
ABRUPT_MAX_S=20
